            <ArticleTitle>Bisphosphonates for metastatic bone pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Bisphosphonates are a class of medications used increasingly to help manage pain due to bony metastases in cancer patients. Newer bisphosphonates used in this way are reviewed and the pharmacokinetic are compared.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
